es an easy way to cleanup Active Directory from dead/old objects based on various criteria. It can also disable, move or delete objects. It can utilize Azure AD, Intune and Jamf to get additional information about objects before deleting them.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/CleanupMonster","line":11},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PSPublishModule: This module is a module builder helper that helps build PowerShell modules \"Evotec way\". It allows us to make sure our modules are built the same way every time making the process really easy to build and publish new versions.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSPublishModule","line":13},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/HtmlForgeX: HtmlForgeX is a .NET library that simplifies the creation of HTML documents, pages and reports. It provides a fluent API to create HTML / CSS / JavaScript without knowing any of it. It is designed to be simple and easy to use, and to provide a way to create HTML content in a more readable and maintainable way.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/HtmlForgeX","line":15},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/GPOZaurr: Group Policy Eater is a PowerShell module that aims to gather information about Group Policies but also allows fixing issues that you may find in them.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/GPOZaurr","line":17},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/SharePointEssentials: SharePointEssentials is a PowerShell module that covers my basic usage of SharePoint. My goal is to keep my SharePoint commands in it. So far the only thing it can do is to synchronize files from local folder to SharePoint Online.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/SharePointEssentials","line":19},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/DbaClientX: DbaClientX is a small PowerShell module that allows running queries against Sql Server","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/DbaClientX","line":21},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/ImagePlayground: ImagePlayground is a PowerShell module that provides a set of functions for image processing. Among other things it can create QRCodes, BarCodes, Charts, and do image processing that can help with daily tasks.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/ImagePlayground","line":23},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/DesktopManager: DesktopManager is a C# library and PowerShell module that allows to get and set wallpapers to given monitor.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/DesktopManager","line":25},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/TheDashboard: TheDashboard is a PowerShell module that generates nice HTML dashboard that's main goal is to integrate multiple reports created by other PowerShell modules. It's main goal is to provide a single place to see all the information you need. It's not meant to be a replacement for other modules.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/TheDashboard","line":27},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/ConsoleMonster: ConsoleMonster is a PowerShell module to build cool GUI applications using Spectre Console and Terminal GUI.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/ConsoleMonster","line":29},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PSWriteOffice: Experimental PowerShell Module to create and edit Microsoft Word, Microsoft Excel, and Microsoft PowerPoint documents without having Microsoft Office installed.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSWriteOffice","line":31},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/DelegationModel: DelegationModel PowerShell module provides a simplified way to manage delegation in Active Directory. It's based on ADEssentials module and builts on top of it.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/DelegationModel","line":33},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/Documentimo: This PowerShell module allows you to create Microsoft Word documents without Word being installed on the machine","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/Documentimo","line":35},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PSWriteExcel: PSWriteExcel is very basic (at the moment) PowerShell module to create Microsoft Excel workbooks without Microsoft Excel installed.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSWriteExcel","line":37},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PSAutomator: This PowerShell Module is new approach to onboarding, offboarding and business as usual processes running in companies infrastructure.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSAutomator","line":39},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PSWriteHTML.Helper: A little project to help with automating some tasks to build, and update PSWriteHTML","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSWriteHTML.Helper","line":41},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PSWinDocumentation: PowerShell Module that creates Word/Excel/SQL documentation from Active Directory (AD), AWS, Office 365 and others. It's a work in progress!","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSWinDocumentation","line":43},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/MarkdownPrince: PowerShell module that helps converting HTML files into Markdown","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/MarkdownPrince","line":45},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PSWriteHTML.Maps: PSWriteHTML.Maps is an example plugin/extension to PSWriteHTML that adds ability to display MAPS in PSWriteHTML reports. This is proof of concept and good example for adding a single functionality to PSWriteHTML.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSWriteHTML.Maps","line":47},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PSHacktoberFest: PowerShell module to make hacktoberfest opt-in easy and fast for big organizations","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSHacktoberFest","line":49},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/Connectimo","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/Connectimo","line":51},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/Statusimo: PowerShell Generated Status Page","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/Statusimo","line":53},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/Excelimo","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/Excelimo","line":55},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PesterInfrastructureTests: A collection of infrastructure related tests for use with Pester & PowerShell.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PesterInfrastructureTests","line":57},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/Dashimo: Dashimo is very simple, intuitive PowerShell generated HTML file. That's right. A single, static HTML file that you can send to email or host on a website.","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/Dashimo","line":59},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PSLansweeper: PowerShell Module to interact with Lansweeper Database","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSLansweeper","line":61},{"title":"EvotecIT/PSWinDocumentation.VM · GitHub","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSWinDocumentation.VM","line":63},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PSUnifi","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSUnifi","line":65},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/LittleInfrastructureManager","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/LittleInfrastructureManager","line":67},{"title":"GitHub - EvotecIT/PSManageService: Proof of concept for reading services (Get-Service -ComputerName -Name ) with runspaces (parallel processing)","target":"https://github.com/EvotecIT/PSManageService","line":69},{"title":"The only command you will ever need to understand and fix your Group Policies (GPO) - Evotec","target":"https://evotec.xyz/the-only-command-you-will-ever-need-to-understand-and-fix-your-group-policies-gpo/","line":71}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},